What:		/sys/bus/platform/devices/10008000.timer/wake_after_ms
Date:		October 2026
Contact:	X20 Bring-up <admin@taterli.com>
Description:
		Write 1..600000 to arm one GPT4 32.768 kHz one-shot wake interrupt
		that many milliseconds from the write, or 0 to disarm it. A new
		write replaces the existing deadline. Reading reports the armed
		delay, total fired count, counter, compare and control register.
		It is a relative wake timer, not an RTC alarm. GPT2 separately
		supplies a 32-bit non-stop sleep clock for timekeeping; GPT4's
		deadline starts immediately, including suspend preparation time.
